<% content_for :title, "BillieWeather" %>
<section class="bw-hero">
  <div class="bw-hero-copy">
    <span class="bw-eyebrow"><span class="bw-status-dot"></span> YOUR FINANCES, IN FOCUS</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(38px, 5.1vw, 71px);">BillieWeather</h1>
    <p>Turn your bank statements into a clear view of your spending and a simple cash flow forecast.</p>
    <div class="bw-hero-actions">
      <% if user_signed_in? %>
        <%= link_to "Go to dashboard", finance_dashboard_path, class: "bw-button bw-button-dark bw-button-large" %>
      <% else %>
        <%= link_to "Create an account", new_user_registration_path, class: "bw-button bw-button-dark bw-button-large" %>
        <%= link_to "Log in", new_user_session_path, class: "bw-text-link" %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <div class="bw-hero-details"><span><%= finance_icon "check", size: 16 %> No bank login required</span><span><%= finance_icon "check", size: 16 %> Free basic analysis</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="bw-hero-art" aria-label="Import a statement, review your transactions, and see your cash flow forecast">
    <span class="bw-art-orbit bw-orbit-one"></span><span class="bw-art-orbit bw-orbit-two"></span>
    <div class="bw-outlook-card">
      <div class="bw-outlook-top"><span class="bw-mini-brand">b·</span><span>YOUR FINANCIAL OUTLOOK</span><%= finance_icon "sun", size: 28 %></div>
      <h2>A clear view of<br>your money.</h2>
      <p>Your statements, transactions,<br>and cash flow in one place.</p>
      <div class="bw-outlook-steps"><span><i>01</i> Import your statements <%= finance_icon "file", size: 17 %></span><span><i>02</i> Review your transactions <%= finance_icon "transactions", size: 17 %></span><span><i>03</i> See your cash flow forecast <%= finance_icon "forecast", size: 17 %></span></div>
      <div class="bw-outlook-footer"><span class="bw-status-dot"></span> Built around your real numbers</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bw-floating-note"><span class="bw-note-icon"><%= finance_icon "insights", size: 22 %></span><div><strong>Less guesswork.</strong><small>More room to plan.</small></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="bw-marketing-section" id="features">
  <div class="bw-section-heading"><span class="bw-eyebrow">FROM STATEMENTS TO CLARITY</span><h2>What it does</h2></div>
  <div class="bw-feature-grid">
    <article class="bw-feature-card"><div class="bw-feature-icon"><%= finance_icon "upload", size: 26 %></div><h3>Import statements.</h3><p>Upload a CSV or a text-based PDF statement from your bank, review each transaction, and keep the categories that fit.</p></article>
    <article class="bw-feature-card"><div class="bw-feature-icon"><%= finance_icon "dashboard", size: 26 %></div><h3>See where your money goes.</h3><p>A dashboard shows income, spending, categories, and recent activity in one place.</p></article>
    <article class="bw-feature-card"><div class="bw-feature-icon"><%= finance_icon "forecast", size: 26 %></div><h3>Forecast your cash flow.</h3><p>Set your current balance and see how it could change if recent patterns continue.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="bw-marketing-section bw-marketing-split" id="how-it-works">
  <div><span class="bw-eyebrow">ONE STEP AT A TIME</span><h2>How it works</h2><ol class="bw-numbered-list"><li><strong>Create an account and sign in.</strong></li><li><strong>Upload a bank statement.</strong><p>No bank login is required.</p></li><li><strong>Review the imported transactions.</strong></li><li><strong>Open the dashboard and forecast.</strong></li></ol></div>
  <div class="bw-feature-list">
    <article><%= finance_icon "file", size: 24 %><div><h3>Prepare for tax season.</h3><p>Flag transactions for review and keep an organized record to share with your tax professional.</p></div></article>
    <article><%= finance_icon "insights", size: 24 %><div><h3>Free basic analysis.</h3><p>Generate a written summary of your spending patterns when you want one. Basic analysis is available without a paid AI service.</p></div></article>
  </div>
</section>
<footer class="bw-public-footer"><span class="bw-brand">BillieWeather</span><p>BillieWeather provides financial organization and estimates only. It is not individualized financial, legal, or tax advice.</p></footer>
